     uurrnngg — USB Random Number Generator devices

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     uurrnngg** aatt uuhhuubb??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uurrnngg driver provides support for various true random number generator
     (TRNG) devices connected via USB.  uurrnngg reads raw entropy from the device
     at a (hardware dependent) interval and stirs it into the system entropy
     pool with enqueue_randomness(9).

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The following devices are supported by this driver:

     Araneus Alea I and II
                   Capable of delivering 100kbit/sec of hardware-generated en‐
                   tropy.

     Altus Metrum ChaosKey 1.0
                   This device is capable of providing entropy at 10Mbit/s.

